{"request_sha256": "0d7b78a8a06add227ba2087c75d12f35698bb41ea81599622c8bf6b96aa7d836", "prompt_sha256": "847dd718e56258447ec5fcc89fdaadc9701165d02eab0b51001e616ebc1a0329", "dispatched_prompt_sha256": "b589845d873d20b85dec4ee6e44b5ada2dbfcd3f66e3fc30c8aa9919dac84773", "schema_sha256": "30f41622e6c7560e23f9cf8ab8aee356761b3ddea7cb1a9d1835cabc34f30ac0", "model": "opus", "model_identity_basis": "claude CLI result event modelUsage key: claude-opus-5", "effort": "medium", "status": "ok", "forbidden_tools": [], "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "output_tokens": 11820}, "answer": {"passes": ["fail", "fail", "fail", "unknown", "fail", "fail", "fail", "fail", "pass", "pass"], "defects": ["Crown fronds read as thin radiating spokes, not long arching pinnate fronds: in render-0 and render-1 the frond blades are sparse, ragged filament-like strands with leaflets rendered as small scattered specks; no frond descends below the crown base and none shows the recurved arch of reference-0/reference-1.", "Frond length relative to trunk is far short of reference: in reference-0 frond length is a substantial fraction of the visible trunk; in render-0/render-1 the crown is a small tuft at the apex of a very long trunk.", "Trunk silhouette is wavy: render-0, render-1 and render-2 all show distinct kinks/inflections in the upper-mid trunk (a pronounced elbow roughly a third below the crown), contradicting the owner requirement of straight or gently leaning.", "Trunk diameter is not near-constant: the trunk narrows continuously from a flared base to the crown in render-0, render-1 and render-2, whereas reference-1/reference-2 show a columnar stem of roughly constant diameter.", "Trunk surface is smooth and untextured in render-2; no retained leaf-base stubs, no diamond/rhomboid spiral lattice, no fibrous matting, against reference-1 and reference-2 where these dominate the trunk.", "P-BASE (render-3) is unusable for its assigned trait: the frame is an extreme close crop of a near-black, shadow-clipped trunk face with no resolvable surface structure.", "No pendent fruit bunches anywhere in render-0/render-1, against reference-0."], "observations": ["Both P-WHOLE seeds (render-0, render-1) are consistent with each other in crown size, frond form and trunk posture; the findings are not seed-specific.", "Nothing grows on the trunk in render-0 and render-1 - the trunk is clean along its whole length, matching the owner requirement (and reference-0; the epiphytic ferns of reference-1/reference-2 are scene features, not required character).", "A single unbranched stem carrying an apical rosette is drawn in all three render views; the branchless, single-apex topology matches the references.", "The crown has roughly 20-30 frond axes radiating from one apical point in render-0/render-1, within the reference count band, but the axes are held in a near-flat starburst rather than a hemispherical/shuttlecock envelope.", "render-2 (P-TRUNK) frames the upper trunk and crown rather than the mid-trunk band of reference-1, but the drawn trunk surface is fully visible and resolvable across the frame, so trunk-surface traits are assessable there.", "Finish quality against the spruce anchor (anchor-0) is not the limiting factor here; the mismatches are morphological, not stylistic, and no trait below is dismissed as a photorealism shortfall.", "Owner-stated scope: trunk organs (fn-110) and the date cluster (fn-111) are not landed. That explains, but does not resolve, the corresponding core-trait absences, which are recorded as mismatches against the frozen inventory.", "Improvement relative to any earlier pass is not assessed here and would not substitute for absolute readiness."], "findings": [{"observation": "In render-0 and render-1 each frond is a thin straight-to-slightly-curved spoke with sparse speck-like leaflets; no frond arches downward and none drops below the crown base, unlike the recurved outer and drooping lower fronds of reference-0 and reference-1.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": "Consistent with leaflet size and frond length dials sitting far below reference scale, as the owner notes; mechanism not established from the images."}, {"observation": "Frond length is small relative to trunk length in render-0/render-1, producing a tuft-like crown; reference-0 shows crown spread several times trunk width with fronds a substantial fraction of trunk length.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "The trunk shows repeated kinks/inflections (a marked elbow in the upper-mid trunk and a second lower bend) in render-0, render-1 and render-2.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "The trunk tapers continuously from a broad base to a narrow apex in all render views; references show near-constant diameter (reference-1, reference-2) or a swollen basal curve only (reference-0).", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": "The host note records the taper dial at 1.0, outside the authored 0.05-0.6 range; that is an attributed configuration statement, not something read from the images."}, {"observation": "The trunk surface in render-2 is uniformly smooth with only shading gradients; no leaf-base stubs, lattice or fibre are drawn.", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": "Owner states the trunk organs (fn-110) are not landed in this pass."}, {"observation": "render-3 (P-BASE) shows a near-black, tonally clipped trunk wall filling the frame with no discernible surface detail; the tree base and ground junction are outside the crop.", "evidence_ids": ["render-3", "reference-2"], "impact": "required_unknown", "uncertain": true, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "No pendent fruiting bunches are present in render-0 or render-1; reference-0 shows two to three heavy orange bunches below the crown.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "blocker", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": "Owner states the date cluster (fn-111) is not landed in this pass."}, {"observation": "The trunk carries no foliage, epiphytes or sprouts over its entire length in render-0 and render-1.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "A single unbranched stem terminating in one apical rosette is drawn in every render view.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "supported", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "Frond colour in render-0/render-1 is a dark saturated green, within the deep-green to grey-glaucous band spanned by the references; colour is not a defining mismatch.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "impact": "variation", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "Trunk posture leans only slightly in render-0/render-1; lean by itself sits inside the reference range (strongly leaning in reference-0, vertical in reference-1/reference-2). The waviness, not the lean, is the mismatch.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "variation", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}, {"observation": "The trunk is a flat dark brown with strong terminator shading in all render views; reference trunks are mid grey-brown to warm reddish-brown with lighter stub faces. Recorded as finish/refinement, not defining character.", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "impact": "optional", "uncertain": false, "causal_hypothesis": null}], "coverage": [{"trait_id": "crown-pinnate-arching-fronds", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "Fronds radiate as thin, short, near-straight spokes in a flat starburst; no outward-and-downward arch, no drooping lower fronds, no rounded hemispheric/shuttlecock crown outline. Defining mismatch against reference-0 and reference-1."}, {"trait_id": "leaflet-arrangement-stiff-narrow", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Leaflets render as sparse, detached specks and short fragments scattered along each rachis; render-2 resolves them at close range and they neither read as narrow stiff linear-lanceolate blades nor produce the plumose V-sectioned, bristly frond margin of the references. Evidence suffices to resolve, so this is a mismatch rather than unknown."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-0", "render-1", "reference-1", "reference-2", "reference-0"], "explanation": "The trunk drawn in render-2 is smooth along its full visible length; no stubs, no spiral diamond lattice, not even a knobbly distance texture in render-0/render-1. Assessed on what is drawn; the absence is visible, not inferred. The owner's note that fn-110 is unlanded explains the gap without converting it to a pass."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-fibrous-matting", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "No fibre, husk or shaggy interstitial material anywhere on the rendered trunk, against the packed reddish-brown matting of reference-1 and reference-2."}, {"trait_id": "solitary-columnar-stem", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "The solitary unbranched half of the trait is supported in every view, but the columnar, roughly-constant-diameter half is not: the stem tapers strongly from base to apex and is wavy with pronounced kinks. Failed on the diameter/posture component."}, {"trait_id": "fruit-clusters-pendent", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "No inflorescence or fruit bunch is drawn below the crown in either P-WHOLE seed, where reference-0 shows two to three heavy pendent orange bunches. Recorded as a core mismatch; the owner's note that fn-111 is unlanded is scope, not resolution."}, {"trait_id": "dead-frond-skirt", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Secondary trait. No brown collar of collapsed dead fronds beneath the living crown in either seed; the crown-to-trunk transition is abrupt and bare. Not a blocker at this priority."}, {"trait_id": "frond-colour-range", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Variation trait. The rendered dark green sits within the deep-green to grey-glaucous band the references span; acceptable variation, not defining character."}, {"trait_id": "petiole-base-orange-sheath", "status": "unknown", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "Secondary trait. The crown apex in render-2 is a small, dark, low-contrast cluster; petiole bases and any sheath colour are not resolvable at the drawn scale."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-lean-and-curve", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Variation trait, but the rendered form falls outside the band it describes: the references span a smooth strong lean with a single basal curve (reference-0) to fully vertical and straight (reference-1, reference-2); the render is near-vertical with multiple mid-trunk kinks, which no reference shows and which the owner rules out explicitly."}, {"trait_id": "epiphytes-on-trunk", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "render-2", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Variation trait, observed in reference-1/reference-2 only and absent from reference-0. The bare rendered trunk sits inside this range and satisfies the owner's requirement that nothing grow on the trunk."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-colour-and-weathering", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-2", "reference-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Secondary trait. The rendered trunk is flat dark brown to near-black with no lighter stub faces, no bleaching and no weathering variation along its length; the reference range is mid grey-brown to warm reddish-brown with tonal variation. Finish-level, not a blocker."}, {"trait_id": "basal-flare", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "Secondary trait, itself flagged uncertain in the inventory. A flare is drawn at ground level in render-0/render-1, but it is a short abrupt conical cuff resting on the ground plane rather than a broad rooted base merging into a soil mound; recorded as a mismatch at secondary priority, weighted down by the inventory's own uncertainty."}, {"trait_id": "crown-shaft-absent", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1"], "explanation": "Secondary trait. No smooth green crownshaft is drawn; frond bases sit directly on the trunk, as in reference-1. Supported, though trivially so given the trunk carries no surface organs at all."}, {"trait_id": "basal-leaflet-spines", "status": "unknown", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Secondary trait, uncertain in the inventory. The proximal frond region in render-2 is occluded by the dense dark apex cluster; presence or absence of reduced spine-like basal leaflets cannot be read."}, {"trait_id": "crown-silhouette-proportions", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "Variation trait, but the rendered proportion falls below the range rather than within it: crown spread is roughly a fifth of trunk height and fronds are short relative to trunk length, against reference-0 where crown spread is several times trunk width and frond length is a substantial fraction of the visible trunk. Ratios are not measured precisely; the direction and magnitude of the gap are unambiguous at silhouette level."}]}, "raw_events": "{"type":"system","subtype":"init","cwd":"/home/daniel/Projects/telperion/.worktrees/fn-80-the-gap-loops-first-live-run","session_id":"ca95480a-cde2-4380-8563-e195d9df698e","tools":["StructuredOutput"],"mcp_servers":[],"model":"claude-opus-5","permissionMode":"default","slash_commands":["deep-research","design","design-sync","dataviz","update-config","verify","debug","code-review","simplify","batch","fewer-permission-prompts","doctor","loop","schedule","claude-api","workflow-authoring","run","run-skill-generator","advisor","agents","auto-mode-setup","autocompact","clear","color","compact","config","output-style","context","effort","fast","heapdump","init","mcp","import","model","__remote-workflow","workflow-launch-exec","reload-plugins","reload-skills","rename","ultrareview","security-review","usage-credits","extra-usage","usage","insights","recap","skill-doctor","goal","design-consent","design-revoke","list-agents","team-onboarding"],"terminal_slash_commands":["doctor","color","reload-plugins"],"apiKeySource":"none","claude_code_version":"2.1.278","output_style":"default","agents":["claude","Explore","general-purpose","Plan"],"skills":["deep-research","design","design-sync","dataviz","update-config","verify","debug","code-review","simplify","batch","fewer-permission-prompts","doctor","loop","schedule","claude-api","workflow-authoring","run","run-skill-generator"],"plugins":[{"name":"flow-next","p